Kintsugi downstream patch against vendored BuildKit v0.34.0 (docker-v29.9.2).
Direction: https://github.com/containerd/containerd/issues/14015
Resolve mount-manager instructions and fetch only layers that need applying.
The opt-in image exporter flag is store-allow-incomplete=true.
Original compressed blobs are still needed for save/push to an empty registry.
This changes embedded BuildKit only, not docker-container builder images.

